# NOTE: lib/ is intentionally COMMITTED.
#
# The installed harness serves `exports["./client"]` byte for byte and never
# bundles a third-party browser half, so a clone that has not been built cannot
# load. Shipping the built artifacts is what makes a plain git install work
# without running a build script.
